            <ArticleTitle>Body mass index in Th1 and Th2 diseases.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>119-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.imlet.2008.01.003</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Several studies have outlined a relationship between increased body mass index (BMI) and respiratory allergic diseases. This study provides evidence of a significant different BMI between Th2-mediated disorders and Th1-mediated ones.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
